# Safety

- Secrets (passwords, keys, tokens, `.env`, local configs) never go into code,
  commits, or model context.
- Do not edit production directly; destructive ops on live data only with
  explicit confirmation and a dry-run on a copy.
- Before a risky change — show the diff and rollback plan, ask for confirmation.
- Full rules live in `../../AGENTS.md`.
